OL,3,GNEWSATraining firm to open campus at
OL,4,Aclosed sixth form
OL,5,
OL,6,FA closed sixth form building is to be
OL,7,Freopened to offer vocational courses
OL,8,Frun by a private training provider.
OL,10,FReagit Engineering Training will take
OL,11,Fover the centre at Sheringham High
OL,12,FSchool in Norfolk within the next 12
OL,13,Fmonths.
OL,15,FSynergy Multi Academy Trust (SMAT),
OL,16,Fwhich runs 14 schools in the county, is
OL,17,Fteaming up with the company, which has
OL,18,Fan engineering training centre in
OL,19,FNorwich.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
